{"parents": [{"link": "../../", "title": "API Reference"}, {"link": "../", "title": "auth0_api_python"}], "prev": {"link": "../api_client/", "title": "auth0_api_python.api_client"}, "next": {"link": "../config/", "title": "auth0_api_python.config"}, "title": "auth0_api_python.cache", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth0_api_python.cache\">\n<span id=\"auth0-api-python-cache\"></span><h1>auth0_api_python.cache<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth0_api_python.cache\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"classes\">\n<h2>Classes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#classes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter\" title=\"auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CacheAdapter</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Abstract base class for cache implementations.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache\" title=\"auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InMemoryCache</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Default in-memory cache implementation with LRU eviction.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.cache.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CacheAdapter</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">abc.ABC</span></code></p>\n<p>Abstract base class for cache implementations.</p>\n<p>Allows custom cache backends (Redis, Memcached, etc.) to be plugged into\nthe ApiClient for caching OIDC discovery metadata and JWKS.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>class RedisCache(CacheAdapter):</dt><dd><dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>def __init__(self, redis_client):</dt><dd><p>self.redis = redis_client</p>\n</dd>\n<dt>def get(self, key: str) -&gt; Optional[Any]:</dt><dd><p>value = self.redis.get(key)\nreturn json.loads(value) if value else None</p>\n</dd>\n<dt>def set(self, key: str, value: Any, ttl_seconds: Optional[int] = None) -&gt; None:</dt><dd><p>self.redis.set(key, json.dumps(value), ex=ttl_seconds)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt>def delete(self, key: str) -&gt; None:</dt><dd><p>self.redis.delete(key)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt>def clear(self) -&gt; None:</dt><dd><p>self.redis.flushdb()</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter.get\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter.get\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get value from cache by key.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>key</strong> \u2013 Cache key to retrieve</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Cached value if found and not expired, None otherwise</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter.set\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">ttl_seconds</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter.set\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set value in cache with optional TTL.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>key</strong> \u2013 Cache key to store</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>value</strong> \u2013 Value to cache</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>ttl_seconds</strong> \u2013 Time-to-live in seconds. None means no expiration.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter.delete\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delete</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter.delete\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Delete value from cache.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>key</strong> \u2013 Cache key to delete</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter.clear\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">clear</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter.clear\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Clear all cache entries.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.cache.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">InMemoryCache</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">max_entries</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">100</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter\" title=\"auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CacheAdapter</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Default in-memory cache implementation with LRU eviction.</p>\n<p>Designed for asyncio (single-threaded).\nFor multi-threaded environments, implement a custom CacheAdapter\nwith appropriate locking.</p>\n<p>Features:\n- TTL (time-to-live) support per entry using monotonic clock\n- LRU (Least Recently Used) eviction when max_entries reached\n- No external dependencies</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>max_entries</strong> \u2013 Maximum number of entries to cache. When exceeded,\nleast recently used entry is evicted. Default: 100.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<p>cache = InMemoryCache(max_entries=50)\ncache.set(\u201ckey1\u201d, {\u201cdata\u201d: \u201cvalue\u201d}, ttl_seconds=600)\nvalue = cache.get(\u201ckey1\u201d)  # Returns {\u201cdata\u201d: \u201cvalue\u201d}</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache.get\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache.get\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get value from cache by key.</p>\n<p>Updates access order for LRU tracking.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>key</strong> \u2013 Cache key to retrieve</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Cached value if found and not expired, None otherwise</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache.set\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">ttl_seconds</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache.set\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set value in cache with optional TTL.</p>\n<p>If cache is at max capacity, evicts least recently used entry.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>key</strong> \u2013 Cache key to store</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>value</strong> \u2013 Value to cache</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>ttl_seconds</strong> \u2013 Time-to-live in seconds. None means no expiration.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache.delete\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delete</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache.delete\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Delete value from cache.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>key</strong> \u2013 Cache key to delete</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache.clear\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">clear</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache.clear\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Clear all cache entries.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["autoapi/auth0_api_python/config/index", "auth0_api_python.config", "N", "next"], ["autoapi/auth0_api_python/api_client/index", "auth0_api_python.api_client", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "autoapi/auth0_api_python/cache/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">auth0_api_python.cache</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#classes\">Classes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CacheAdapter</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter.get\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CacheAdapter.get()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter.set\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CacheAdapter.set()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter.delete\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CacheAdapter.delete()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.CacheAdapter.clear\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CacheAdapter.clear()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InMemoryCache</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache.get\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InMemoryCache.get()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache.set\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InMemoryCache.set()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache.delete\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InMemoryCache.delete()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.cache.InMemoryCache.clear\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InMemoryCache.clear()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "autoapi/auth0_api_python/cache/index", "sidebars": ["about.html", "searchfield.html", "navigation.html", "relations.html", "donate.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0]}